#AREA Monastery of Order~
#AUTHORS Deadblt~





#HELPS
-1 monastery~
      The monasterys of Order and Chaos were founded to help the
      warrior followers of each god to fight and achieve supremacy
      in the Realms.  The monasterys provide a safe haven from
      attack by enemies, as well as special equipment for followers.

           (-) Other mud areas by Deadbolt.


{-}Deadbolt
~
0 $~




#RANGES 0 99 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#16102
order avatar~
the Avatar of Order~
The avatar of Order stands here, glowing brightly.~
In it's right hand is a nail, symbolic of the organizing aspect of Order.
Order brings together, creates structure, and names all things in the world.
In society, this means the forming of organizations.  Groups of individuals
that will support and help eachother.

In its left hand is a sword, symbolic of the separating aspect of Order.
Order separates, removes the false, and distinguishes one thing from another.
In society, this means separating those who belong and those who do not.
Removing from the group the undesirables, by force if necessary.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN
0 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 2d2000+10000 25d7+19
0 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n) == 1
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Order says 'Greetings warrior of Order'
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Order says 'Everything and everyone here'
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Order says 'is at your service.  If you'
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Order says 'need the special equipment,'
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Order says 'just ask.'
endif
~
>speech_prog equipment token hole~
if whichgod($n) != 1
  slay $n
  say SILENCE INFIDEL!
else
  mpecho The Avatar of Order says 'remember, you can only' 
  mpecho The Avatar of Order says 'get the equipment once every'
  mpecho The Avatar of Order says 'ten levels.'
  if quest(1,1,$n) == 0
    if level($n) >= 10
      if level($n) < 20
        mpoload 16101
        if actorhasobjnum(16101)
          mpjunk token161_0
          mpechoat $n The Avatar of Order says 'You already have a token.'
        endif
        give token161_O $n
        mpjunk token161_O
        mpoload 16102
        if actorhasobjnum(16102)
          mpjunk hole161_0
          mpechoat $n The Avatar of Order says 'You already have a hole.'
        endif
        give hole161_O $n
        mpjunk hole161_O
        mpmset $n quest 1 1 1
      endif
    endif
  endif
  if quest(2,1,$n) == 0
    if level($n) >= 20
      if level($n) < 30
        mpoload 16101
        if actorhasobjnum(16101)
          mpjunk token161_0
          mpechoat $n The Avatar of Order says 'You already have a token.'
        endif
        give token161_O $n
