#16105
order high knight~
The High Knight of Order~
The High Knight of Order stands here, guarding the Monastery.~
The Knight has steel blue eyes, the kind you hear about in
legends.  With its helm off and bright shining silver armor
it does look like something out of a legend.  It never moves
much, but it seems to be totally aware of everything.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY
0 S
149 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 2d2000+30000 35d7+49
0 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>rand_prog 100~
if quest(0,2,$i) > 0
  mpgoto 16100
  mpmadd $i quest 0 2 -1 
endif
~
>range_prog 100~
mpmset $i quest 0 2 2
~
>greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n) == 2
  mpechoat $n The High Knight of Order screams 'Infidel!'
  mpkill $n
else
  if whichgod($n) == 1
    mpechoat $n The High Knight of Order nods.
  else
    mpechoat $n The High Knight of Order sends you packing.
    mptransfer $n 17621
    mpat 17621 mpforce $n look
  endif
endif
~
>fight_prog 100~
mpmset $i quest 0 2 2
mpquiet on
cast 'tremor'
~
|
